      "html": "<button class=\"ds-outline\" type=\"button\">가격 기록</button>",
      "css": ".ds-outline{font-family:var(--font-suit),sans-serif;min-height:39px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:500;width:100%;padding:9px;border:1px solid var(--line,#344138);border-radius:4px;background:none;color:var(--muted,#adb8af);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,border-color 160ms,color 160ms;}.ds-outline:hover{color:var(--ink,#edf1e9);border-color:var(--subtle,#91a096);}.ds-outline:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#a5deac);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-outline{min-height:40px;font-size:11px;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button,input{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "상품 검색",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field-search",
      "description": "작업 화면 검색. 컨테이너 테두리로 포커스 진입을 표시한다.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search\"><input type=\"search\" aria-label=\"상품 검색\" placeholder=\"상품 검색\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-search{display:flex;align-items:center;min-width:300px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line,#344138);border-radius:5px;background:var(--surface,#171e19);color:var(--subtle,#91a096);}.ds-search:focus-within{border-color:var(--accent,#a5deac);}.ds-search input{font-family:var(--font-suit),sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;min-height:27px;width:100%;padding:4px 8px;border:0;border-radius:5px;outline:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#edf1e9);}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--subtle,#91a096);opacity:1;}.ds-search input:focus-visible{outline:none;}@media(max-width:1000px){.ds-search{min-width:245px;}}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-search{min-width:0;width:100%;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "주요 내비게이션",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-item",
      "description": "데스크톱 주요 내비게이션의 비활성·활성 상태. 모바일 하단 내비게이션은 별도 구조다.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"미리보기 주요 탐색\"><button type=\"button\">홈</button><button class=\"ds-nav-active\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"page\">상품</button><button type=\"button\">음식점</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:27px;height:82px;background:var(--bg,#101512);}.ds-nav>button{font-family:var(--font-suit),sans-serif;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;height:100%;gap:6px;padding:0 2px;border:0;border-radius:5px;background:none;color:var(--muted,#adb8af);font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms,border-color 160ms,color 160ms;}.ds-nav>button:hover,.ds-nav>.ds-nav-active{color:var(--ink,#edf1e9);}.ds-nav-active::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:2px;background:var(--accent,#a5deac);}.ds-nav>button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#a5deac);outline-offset:4px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){button,input{transition:none;animation:none;}}"
    },
